WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
Compare search strategies and follow every comparison.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:09.090
Check index 3: 17 is small, so keep the right side.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.518
Check index 5: 29 is large.

00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:13.945
Check index 4 and find 23.

00:00:14.945 --> 00:00:18.952
What must be true before binary search can discard half the values?

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:22.625
Sorted order makes each middle comparison sufficient to choose a side.
